 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "sources is a rectangular list of rows of \"key:value\" entries. Each entry splits at its first \":\" into key and value (the value may contain further colons and may be empty). Processing rows from lowest to highest preference and entries left to right, a later entry for the same key overrides an earlier one, so a key's final value comes from the most preferred source that mentions it (its rightmost entry there). Return the final entries as \"key:value\" strings sorted by key (code point order).",
